{
 "_comment": "Bulwark ambient life (town_full3d_ambient.py; px = rest-frame px, ambient_sheet.jpg). A northern town in deep snow under a green aurora, the wind off the eastern peaks blowing everything west: snow falling in three depth layers, aurora rays over the peaks, warm breath steaming in slow beats out of the cave dwellings and the mammoth tent, peat smoke from the real hearths (hut, tent smoke hole, tavern, hall, forge chimney), forge and pyre light pooled on the snow, cinders and ash off the great pyre, meltwater dripping off the warm eaves, powder sifting off the roofs, ice stars on the shards and the ice spires, rime crystals spiralling up the mage spire, arctic sea smoke off the open river, diamond dust in the moonlight, snow snaking over the open field, ravens round the castle and the church spire, spindrift off the castle tower. Kinds snowfall / aurora / ground_snake / diamond_dust / ice_star / rime_swirl / icicle_drip / hearth_smoke / breath_steam / hearth_pool / pyre_cinders / frost_smoke / roof_slough / ravens: bulwark_ambient_kinds.py; spindrift is shared.",
